17:The DRA Driver for NVIDIA GPUs manages two types of resources: **GPUs** and **ComputeDomains**. Correspondingly, it contains two DRA kubelet plugins: [gpu-kubelet-plugin](https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/dra-driver-nvidia-gpu/tree/main/cmd/gpu-kubelet-plugin), [compute-domain-kubelet-plugin](https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/dra-driver-nvidia-gpu/tree/main/cmd/compute-domain-kubelet-plugin). Upon driver installation, each of these two parts can be enabled or disabled separately.
